Package: 1bit-systems
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libxrt2 (>= 2.21), libxrt-npu2
Maintainer: admin@1bit.systems
Description: One binary to rule them all — 5 models, 120KB, 28 tok/s NPU
 1bit.systems is a pure native inference stack for the AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395.
 Runs Qwen3-0.6B/8B/VL-4B, Llama-3.1-8B, and Gemma4-E2B on XDNA 2 NPU.
 Auto-detect. One binary. Zero Python. Zero pip. Zero Docker.
 .
 28 tok/s on Qwen3-0.6B at M=32 batch with OpenMP attention.
 All benchmarks at engine/npu/BENCHMARKS.md.
